      "title": "Letterboxd review of Due Date",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"Due Date\"] I had a lot more fun with this than I expected. The whole movie is just one disaster after another, and somehow it keeps getting funnier every time things fall apart. Robert Downey Jr. plays the straight man perfectly while Zach Galifianakis steals almost every scene with his awkward charm. It’s not trying to be anything more than a ridiculous road trip comedy, and it nails that from start to finish.",
